@host = http://127.0.0.1:8931

### 块1 健康与后端清单（浏览器直接打开也行）
GET {{host}}/actuator/health

### 块2 tools/list
POST {{host}}/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
MCP-Protocol-Version: 2026-07-28
Mcp-Method: tools/list

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":1,"method":"tools/list","params":{"_meta":{"io.modelcontextprotocol/protocolVersion":"2026-07-28","io.modelcontextprotocol/clientCapabilities":{}}}}

### 块3 裸 SELECT（全链路 happy path）
POST {{host}}/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
MCP-Protocol-Version: 2026-07-28
Mcp-Method: tools/call
Mcp-Name: analytics_run_sql

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":2,"method":"tools/call","params":{"name":"analytics_run_sql","arguments":{"sql":"SELECT customer, amount FROM orders ORDER BY amount DESC"},"_meta":{"io.modelcontextprotocol/protocolVersion":"2026-07-28","io.modelcontextprotocol/clientCapabilities":{}}}}

### 块4 limit 与截断
POST {{host}}/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
MCP-Protocol-Version: 2026-07-28
Mcp-Method: tools/call
Mcp-Name: analytics_run_sql

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":3,"method":"tools/call","params":{"name":"analytics_run_sql","arguments":{"sql":"SELECT * FROM orders ORDER BY id","limit":2},"_meta":{"io.modelcontextprotocol/protocolVersion":"2026-07-28","io.modelcontextprotocol/clientCapabilities":{}}}}

### 块5 DELETE 被拒（期望 HTTP 200 + isError:true）
POST {{host}}/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
MCP-Protocol-Version: 2026-07-28
Mcp-Method: tools/call
Mcp-Name: analytics_run_sql

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":4,"method":"tools/call","params":{"name":"analytics_run_sql","arguments":{"sql":"DELETE FROM orders"},"_meta":{"io.modelcontextprotocol/protocolVersion":"2026-07-28","io.modelcontextprotocol/clientCapabilities":{}}}}

### 块5b 确认表没被删（期望 count = 4）
POST {{host}}/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
MCP-Protocol-Version: 2026-07-28
Mcp-Method: tools/call
Mcp-Name: analytics_run_sql

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":5,"method":"tools/call","params":{"name":"analytics_run_sql","arguments":{"sql":"SELECT count(*) FROM orders"},"_meta":{"io.modelcontextprotocol/protocolVersion":"2026-07-28","io.modelcontextprotocol/clientCapabilities":{}}}}

### 块6 多语句被拒（期望 "Only one statement per call is allowed"）
POST {{host}}/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
MCP-Protocol-Version: 2026-07-28
Mcp-Method: tools/call
Mcp-Name: analytics_run_sql

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":6,"method":"tools/call","params":{"name":"analytics_run_sql","arguments":{"sql":"SELECT 1; DROP TABLE orders"},"_meta":{"io.modelcontextprotocol/protocolVersion":"2026-07-28","io.modelcontextprotocol/clientCapabilities":{}}}}

### 块7 真 SQL 错误（期望 HTTP 200 + isError + "SQL error:"）
POST {{host}}/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
MCP-Protocol-Version: 2026-07-28
Mcp-Method: tools/call
Mcp-Name: analytics_run_sql

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":7,"method":"tools/call","params":{"name":"analytics_run_sql","arguments":{"sql":"SELECT * FROM no_such_table"},"_meta":{"io.modelcontextprotocol/protocolVersion":"2026-07-28","io.modelcontextprotocol/clientCapabilities":{}}}}

### 块8 WITH 白名单（不该被误杀，期望 n = 4）
POST {{host}}/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
MCP-Protocol-Version: 2026-07-28
Mcp-Method: tools/call
Mcp-Name: analytics_run_sql

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":8,"method":"tools/call","params":{"name":"analytics_run_sql","arguments":{"sql":"WITH t AS (SELECT count(*) AS n FROM orders) SELECT n FROM t"},"_meta":{"io.modelcontextprotocol/protocolVersion":"2026-07-28","io.modelcontextprotocol/clientCapabilities":{}}}}

### 块9 字面量里的关键字（不该被误杀，期望正常返回文本）
POST {{host}}/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
MCP-Protocol-Version: 2026-07-28
Mcp-Method: tools/call
Mcp-Name: analytics_run_sql

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":9,"method":"tools/call","params":{"name":"analytics_run_sql","arguments":{"sql":"SELECT 'drop table orders' AS warning"},"_meta":{"io.modelcontextprotocol/protocolVersion":"2026-07-28","io.modelcontextprotocol/clientCapabilities":{}}}}

### 块10 头不匹配（期望 HTTP 400 + error.code -32020）
POST {{host}}/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
MCP-Protocol-Version: 2026-07-28
Mcp-Method: tools/list
Mcp-Name: analytics_run_sql

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":10,"method":"tools/call","params":{"name":"analytics_run_sql","arguments":{"sql":"SELECT 1"},"_meta":{"io.modelcontextprotocol/protocolVersion":"2026-07-28","io.modelcontextprotocol/clientCapabilities":{}}}}

### 块11 SSE 流式（这个在 REST Client 里看不出"边跑边到"，建议改用 curl.exe -N）
POST {{host}}/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
MCP-Protocol-Version: 2026-07-28
Mcp-Method: tools/call
Mcp-Name: compute_slow_sum
Accept: text/event-stream

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":11,"method":"tools/call","params":{"name":"compute_slow_sum","arguments":{"n":8},"_meta":{"io.modelcontextprotocol/protocolVersion":"2026-07-28","io.modelcontextprotocol/clientCapabilities":{},"progressToken":"p1","io.modelcontextprotocol/logLevel":"info"}}}

### 块12 analytics_list_tables（目录层，期望 events + orders 两张表）
POST {{host}}/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
MCP-Protocol-Version: 2026-07-28
Mcp-Method: tools/call
Mcp-Name: analytics_list_tables

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":12,"method":"tools/call","params":{"name":"analytics_list_tables","arguments":{},"_meta":{"io.modelcontextprotocol/protocolVersion":"2026-07-28","io.modelcontextprotocol/clientCapabilities":{}}}}

### 块13 analytics_describe_table（目录层，期望 orders 的 4 列和类型）
POST {{host}}/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
MCP-Protocol-Version: 2026-07-28
Mcp-Method: tools/call
Mcp-Name: analytics_describe_table

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":13,"method":"tools/call","params":{"name":"analytics_describe_table","arguments":{"table":"orders"},"_meta":{"io.modelcontextprotocol/protocolVersion":"2026-07-28","io.modelcontextprotocol/clientCapabilities":{}}}}

### 块14 不存在的表（期望 isError，且提示先调 list_tables）
POST {{host}}/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
MCP-Protocol-Version: 2026-07-28
Mcp-Method: tools/call
Mcp-Name: analytics_describe_table

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":14,"method":"tools/call","params":{"name":"analytics_describe_table","arguments":{"table":"no_such_table"},"_meta":{"io.modelcontextprotocol/protocolVersion":"2026-07-28","io.modelcontextprotocol/clientCapabilities":{}}}}

### 块15 目录工具的参数是绑定的（期望 isError，且 orders 表还在）
POST {{host}}/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
MCP-Protocol-Version: 2026-07-28
Mcp-Method: tools/call
Mcp-Name: analytics_describe_table

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":15,"method":"tools/call","params":{"name":"analytics_describe_table","arguments":{"table":"orders'; DROP TABLE orders; --"},"_meta":{"io.modelcontextprotocol/protocolVersion":"2026-07-28","io.modelcontextprotocol/clientCapabilities":{}}}}
